infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Three independent levers against oldest-xmin bloat
  desc Each neutralizes a different way a query pins the global oldest-xmin
  lists
    - label idle_in_transaction_session_timeout = 5–15 min
      desc On the primary: kills forgotten open transactions before their backend_xmin pins bloat
    - label hot_standby_feedback = off
      desc On analytics replicas: stops the replica from sending its xmin back, so primary autovacuum is never held back
    - label Replication-slot lag alerts
      desc Catch orphan slots whose xmin column pins the publisher's oldest-xmin with no active session
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b
